evidenceQuote:
例如，如下代码不能编译：

```rust,ignore,does_not_compile
fn main() {
    let x = 5;
    let y = &mut x;
}
```

如果尝试编译，会得到如下错误：

```text
error[E0596]: cannot borrow immutable local variable `x` as mutable
 --> src/main.rs:3:18
  |
2 |     let x = 5;
  |         - consider changing this to `mut x`
3 |     let y = &mut x;
  |                  ^ cannot borrow mutably
```
